Output docs/assets/force-push.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1280
Set Height 860
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Hide
Type "export PATH=$PWD/scripts/bin:$PATH PS1='$ ' NO_COLOR= && clear"
Enter
Show
Type "dryrun demo force-push --out /tmp/dryrun-demo-force-push"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 9s
